# The voyage itself: wonder, home, ship life, the dark, the approach.
# Arc, motifs and plants: content/STORY_BIBLE.md (spoilers). Voice: content/STYLE.md.

# --- Leaving -------------------------------------------------------------------
card l_reboot
type beat
cat life
clue core
due
once
days 2 9
roles A
when cond A ok
text The galley screen on {A}'s ship installs an update overnight and restarts at breakfast: the cabin lights blink once for the self-test, then the logo, then the chime, all over before {A} has counted to eleven. By the end of the week {A} is humming the chime without noticing.
do morale A 1

card l_manifest
type beat
cat life
clue core
due
once
days 4 9
roles A
when cond A ok
text {A} reads the arrival manifest while a tanker docks, the way some people read horoscopes. Habitat on Cargo 1, water on Cargo 3, the rover on Cargo 4, which sends weather reports. Cargo 2 gets one line, "lost on landing, written off", and a blurry thumbnail: a smudge and a streak. {A} turns the page.
do trait A curious 1

card p_live_call
type beat
cat human
days 1 5
weight 14
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text {A} calls home while the delay is still under a second. Someone tells a bad joke and {A} laughs on the beat, in real time, with everyone at the table. Afterwards {A} writes down who was there and what they ate.
do morale A 5
do mark t_call

card p_garden_plant
type beat
cat life
days 2 8
weight 12
once
roles A B
when same A B
text {A} and {B} plant the garden: six seed pods in a tray the size of a laptop, under a lamp the color of a bruise. {B} labels each pod in tiny capitals. {A} says good night to them, quietly, and nobody comments.
do set garden_planted
do var garden 1
do bond A B 4

card p_garden_tend
type beat
cat life
days 6 38
weight 6
cooldown 7
roles A
when flag garden_planted
when cond A ok
text {A} waters the garden tray with a syringe, two millilitres per pod, and checks each one under the lamp. Nothing yet. {A} logs the nothing as carefully as anything else.
do var garden 1

card p_garden_fail
type beat
cat grim
days 14 28
weight 9
once
roles A
when var garden >= 2
text Four of the six pods in the garden tray have gone soft and grey. {A} lifts them out with tweezers and doesn't say anything for a while. Then {A} refills the syringe for the other two.
do morale A -3
do trait A warm 2

card p_garden_sprout
type beat
cat wonder
days 30 39
weight 16
once
roles A B
when var garden >= 4
when same A B
text {A} calls {B} over without a word. In the last pod in the tray, a white thread has split the seed coat and turned, against no gravity at all, toward the lamp.
do bond A B 6
do morale A 6
do morale B 6

# --- The middle dark ------------------------------------------------------------
card w_venus_shadow
type event
cat wonder
days 10 30
weight 6
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text With the cabin lights off and the shutters open, {A}'s hand throws a faint shadow on the bulkhead. The light source is Venus. {A} stays there for a long time, moving their fingers, making the planet cast them.
do trait A curious 3

card w_phosphene
type beat
once
cat grim
days 14 39
weight 6
roles A
when cond A ok
text {A} closes their eyes in the bunk and sees a white spark, then another. Cosmic rays, passing straight through the eye, fast enough to make light; cameras see them too, as single bright pixels. {A} counts them like sheep and loses count somewhere in the twenties.
do trait A curious 2
do morale A -1

card w_comet
type event
cat wonder
days 12 30
weight 6
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text The magnetometer on {A}'s ship twitches for six hours: the fleet is crossing the ion tail of a comet that rounded the Sun before anyone aboard was born. Nothing to see. {A} sits by the window anyway, with the trace scrolling on a tablet.
do trait A curious 3
do morale A 2

card p_letters
type beat
cat human
days 14 38
weight 7
cooldown 18
roles A
when cond A ok
text The delay has turned calls into letters. {A} records one for home and stops halfway, because there's no one to interrupt. {A} starts again and leaves pauses in it anyway, where the laughs would have been.
do morale A 2
do trait A warm 2

card p_birthday
type beat
cat life
days 5 39
weight 7
once
roles A B
when same A B
text It's {B}'s birthday by the ground calendar. {A} produces a candle that can't be lit, a cake that is a ration bar with a slice of dried mango on it, and a card signed by the whole fleet over a week of transfers. {B} keeps the candle.
do bond A B 6
do morale B 5

card p_movie
type beat
cat life
days 6 39
weight 7
cooldown 20
roles A B
when same A B
text Movie night, on a tablet taped to the ceiling: {A} picked a film set on a submarine. Halfway through, the hull ticks as the ship turns out of the sun, right on cue. {A} pauses it, and {B} and {A} listen until it stops. Nobody presses play again.
do bond A B 4

card p_music
type beat
once
cat human
days 3 39
weight 6
roles A B
when same A B
text {A} plays the same four bars on a travel guitar every evening, never the rest of the song. On the night {B} finally asks, {A} says the rest belongs to someone at home, and plays it all the way through.
do bond A B 5
do trait A warm 1

card p_dream
type beat
once
cat human
days 10 39
weight 5
roles A
when cond A ok
text {A} wakes from a dream of rain on a car roof and lies still, trying to keep the sound. The fans hum. The ship ticks as it turns into the sun. By breakfast the rain has gone, and {A} doesn't mention it.
do morale A -2
do trait A warm 2

card l_long_table
type event
cat life
days 7 39
weight 6
cooldown 7
roles A
when cond A ok
text Every seventh flight day the fleet eats together on video: seven tablets on seven galley tables, one meal at one time. {A} is in charge of the toast. It's short, it isn't funny, and it lands.
do morale A 3

card g_third_quarter
type event
cat grim
days 24 34
weight 9
once
roles A B
when cond A ok
when cond B ok
text Past the halfway mark the quiet gets heavier. The flight surgeon calls it the third-quarter effect. On the video link, {A} notices {B} staring at the same page of a checklist for ten minutes, and starts reading it aloud to them.
do bond A B 6
do morale B 3

card g_news
type event
cat grim
days 16 38
weight 5
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text A message from home for {A}: a funeral, already over. By the time it arrived, the people in the photos had gone home and changed their clothes. {A} watches the recording to the end and asks for the next watch.
do morale A -8
do trait A warm 3

card g_count
type beat
cat grim
days 18 39
weight 5
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text {A} counts the medical kit against the manifest: sutures, splints, a defibrillator with one set of pads. {A} counts it again and closes the lid gently, the way you do when someone is sleeping.
do trait A brave 2

card sharpie2
type beat
cat human
days 26 39
weight 12
once
roles A
when fired dil_stash
when cond A ok
text Under the last tray in the spares locker, {A} finds a roll of tape that isn't on any list. Around it, in the same Sharpie hand: "Still thanking me?" Beside it, the little ship again. This time it has a number on its side: 2. "Every day," {A} tells the empty locker.
do res spares 1
do morale A 5

card p_video_late
type beat
cat human
days 30 39
weight 8
once
roles A
when since t_call >= 25
text A video from home reaches {A} twenty minutes after it was sent and a day after the thing it's about. Everyone in it is cheering at something that is already over. {A} cheers back anyway, at the screen, alone.
do morale A 2

# --- The approach --------------------------------------------------------------
card w_mars_disc
type event
cat wonder
days 39 39
weight 14
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text {A} holds a thumb up to the window, an old habit from the Earth watches. Mars has stopped being a star: it's a disc, rust and a bruise of dark, and it no longer fits behind the nail.
do morale A 5
do trait A curious 2

card w_phobos
type event
cat arrival
days 41 41
weight 14
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text Phobos comes up over the limb like a potato thrown slowly in front of a lamp. {A} watches it cross a whole world in the time it takes to eat a meal, and can't remember the last time they wanted to stand on something this badly.
do trait A curious 2
do morale A 3

card w_aurora
type event
cat arrival
days 33 39
weight 9
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text In one of the orbiters' night frames {A} finds a faint green smear over dark ground: Martian aurora, patchy, pinned to old magnetized rock nobody has ever touched. {A} saves the frame, then sits with it on the screen a while longer than the job needs.
do trait A curious 3

card a_last_night
type beat
cat arrival
days 40 40
weight 14
once
roles A B
when same A B
text The last night before capture. {A} and {B} check the water tanks that shielded them on the flare nights, one more time, by hand. Neither of them sleeps much. Both pretend to, so the other one will.
do bond A B 6

# --- Departure (after the tanker flights) ---------------------------------------
card l_departure
type beat
cat wonder
due
once
days 6 6
roles A
when cond A ok
text The last tanker undocks at dawn. Seven ships light their engines for the departure burn, and {A} feels weight come back for the first time since launch. When the engines stop, Earth has quietly stopped filling the window and started fitting in it.
do morale A 3
